                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "If you like Delicious Emily games then you'll love this one, Angela is Emily's fabulous sister. She loves to do everything her way, her story is fun even with all the drama around her. I've played her two previous games and enjoyed them so much, this one is even better. You'll get to play Angela in her high school years right before she joined 'fabulous four' group and you'll meet her rival Janet, the two girls want to become 'Prom Queen' you'll only have to guess what will happen.\n\nI didn't dislike any character in this game, none of them got on my nerve unlike some of the characters in Delicious Emily games or Heart's Medicine. The story was fun, I laughed at some moments and gasped at others, and as usual, there are some surprises you'll get to find out about it and gasp along with Angela. \nhttps://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=953053836\n\nPros:\n+Beautiful graphics.\n+Nice music\n+Smooth gameplay.\n+Steam achievements.\n\nCons:\n- I wished for more stages, 60 stages weren't enough for me.\n- Needs custom mouse cursor (Sometimes you can't see the default small system cursor when the stage is busy)\n-No steam cloud.\n\nIf you like time management games then you'll enjoy this one, if you don't you'd feel it is a repetitive game. I can't wait for a new adventure with Angela!\n\n[i]Other Reviews from the same series:\n[url=https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198071375554/recommended/540060]Fabulous - Angela's Fashion Fever Review[/url]\n[url=https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198071375554/recommended/802490/]Fabulous - Angela's Wedding Disaster Review[/url]\n[url=https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198071375554/recommended/1005050]Fabulous - Angela's True Colors Review[/url]\n\n[/i]\n\n[quote]𝐹𝑜𝑟 𝑚𝑜𝑟𝑒 𝑟𝑒𝑣𝑖𝑒𝑤𝑠 𝑐𝘩𝑒𝑐𝑘 𝑚𝑦 𝑐𝑢𝑟𝑎𝑡𝑜𝑟 𝑝𝑎𝑔𝑒 [url=http://store.steampowered.com/curator/32399565/]𝐹𝑒𝑒𝑛𝑎'𝑠 𝐶𝘩𝑜𝑖𝑐𝑒[/url][/quote]",
